        <h5 class="mt-0">iOS <small>â€“ please read the instructions!</small></h5>
        <a class="btn btn-sm btn-success" href="/cert/pem" target="_blank">ğŸ” Get mitmproxy-ca-cert.pem</a>
        <a class="btn btn-sm btn-info show-instructions" href="#iOS" id="iOS">ğŸ“–
